      "textRaw": "InjectableWebClient",
      "name": "injectablewebclient",
      "desc": "<p><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebViewClient\">android.webkit.WebViewClient</a>\n的子类。Monkey King 在 Rhino 2.0 中用它把脚本排队到页面加载完成后执行。</p>\n<p>常见相关方法或属性:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../network/web.md#m-newinjectablewebclient\">web.newInjectableWebClient</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注：本页展开 <code>InjectableWebClient</code> 自有成员；继承自 <code>WebViewClient</code> 的成员请参阅\n<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebViewClient\">Android 官方参考</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">InjectableWebClient</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[m#] inject",
          "name": "[m#]_inject",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "inject(script, callback?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "inject",
              "desc": "<p> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>script</strong> { <a href=\"data-types.md#string\">string</a> } - 脚本</li>\n<li><strong>[ callback ]</strong> { <a href=\"data-types.md#function\">(</a>value: <a href=\"data-types.md#string\">string</a><a href=\"data-types.md#function\">)</a> <a href=\"data-types.md#function\">=&gt;</a> <a href=\"data-types.md#void\">void</a> } - 脚本</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"data-types.md#void\">void</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注入 <code>script</code> 参数提供的 JavaScript 脚本, <code>callback</code> 回调参数可用于获取脚本语句的执行结果.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">&#39;ui&#39;;\n\nlet client = web.newInjectableWebClient();\nclient.inject(&#39;navigator.userAgent&#39;, value =&gt; console.log(value));\n\nlet webView = web.newInjectableWebView(&#39;https://example.com&#39;);\nwebView.setWebViewClient(client);\nactivity.setContentView(webView);\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "script"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m#] inject"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m#] injectAndWait",
          "name": "[m#]_injectandwait",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "injectAndWait(script)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "injectAndWait",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**script** { [string](data-types.md#string) } - 脚本 ",
                      "name": "**script**",
                      "type": " [string](data-types.md#string) ",
                      "desc": "脚本"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [string](data-types.md#string) } - 脚本执行结果 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [string](data-types.md#string) ",
                      "desc": "脚本执行结果"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "script"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>注入 <code>script</code> 参数提供的 JavaScript 脚本, 等待脚本执行完毕, 返回执行结果.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">&#39;ui&#39;;\n\nvar client = web.newInjectableWebClient();\nvar webView = web.newInjectableWebView(&#39;https://example.com&#39;);\nwebView.setWebViewClient(client);\nactivity.setContentView(webView);\n\nthreads.start(function () {\n    console.log(client.injectAndWait(&#39;document.title&#39;));\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>inject</code> 在页面尚未完成时进入 FIFO 队列，页面完成后调用 Android\n<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebView#evaluateJavascript(java.lang.String,%20android.webkit.ValueCallback%3Cjava.lang.String%3E\"><code>WebView.evaluateJavascript</code></a>)。\n<code>injectAndWait</code> 会阻塞当前线程直到回调到达，不应在 UI 线程调用；线程被中断时抛出\n<code>ScriptInterruptedException</code>。客户端还会启用 JavaScript 和 file URL 的跨源访问能力，\n因此只应加载可信页面和脚本。</p>\n<p>如果页面尚未触发 <code>onPageFinished</code>，注入请求会留在队列中，<code>injectAndWait</code> 也会持续等待；\n页面加载失败或永不完成时不要在需要及时返回的线程调用它。客户端没有公开的取消队列方法，\n不再使用时应解除 WebView 引用并在 UI 线程销毁 WebView。</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m#] injectAndWait"
        }
      ],
      "type": "module",
